@startuml
title M3 new-flow lane assignment
start
:Receive current-generation channel request;
if (Memory and server admission available?) then (yes)
  if (Control or latency-sensitive DNS?) then (yes)
    :Filter control-eligible capacity;
  else (no)
    if (Likely bulk at open?) then (yes)
      :Filter optional bulk then general capacity;
    else (ordinary)
      :Filter general capacity;
    endif
  endif
  :Exclude failed, closing, rekeying, stale, and pressure-blocked lanes;
  :Order by writable credit, queued bytes, RTT health, and open channels;
  if (Eligible lane exists?) then (yes)
    :Pin flow to selected lane until close;
    :Record aggregate assignment;
  else (no)
    :Return bounded typed admission failure;
  endif
else (no)
  :Return bounded pressure or capacity failure;
endif
stop
@enduml